{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1790751445672,"level":"log","data":["getBlogsData response:","{\"result\":true,\"data\":[{\"id\":4,\"title\":\"Indian Wedding Guide\",\"slug\":\"indian-wedding-guide\",\"banner\":\"http://mudirajworld.runserver.in/public/uploads/all/RZdhfau0OXH4OWwcddGMfjdVpUfcKt4nH2TxEFs6.jpg\",\"category_name\":\"Relationship\",\"short_description\":\"The Essence of RVD Matrimonial Services\\r\\n\\r\\nFounded on principles of trust, integrity, and personalized service,  Mudiraj Matrimony has carved a niche for itself in the matrimonial landscape. With a wealth of experience and a dedicated team, the company has expanded its offerings to include a specialized platform designed for individuals with refined tastes and high aspirations.\",\"description\":\"Mudiraj Matrimony' is a testament to the company's commitment to excellence. The platform seamlessly blends modern technology with traditional matchmaking values, providing a sophisticated space for individuals seeking companionship at a level beyond the ordinary.\"},{\"id\":3,\"title\":\"Which is The Trusted and Best Matrimony Site to get Married?\",\"slug\":\"which-is-the-trusted-and-best-matrimony-site-to-get-married\",\"banner\":\"http://mudirajworld.runserver.in/public/uploads/all/0WtpkD376P0HPcg4o6gJRp3LAncXVmu2YzWtqPEQ.jpg\",\"category_name\":\"Marriage Tips\",\"short_description\":\"When it comes to finding the Best Matrimony Site to Get Married, Trust & Reliability are of utmost Importance. After all, This is a decision that will shape your future and finding a platform that understands your needs and preferences is crucial.\",\"description\":\"In the vast sea of matrimony sites available today, it can be overwhelming to choose the right one. However, there is one platform that stands out as a trusted and reliable option - Pooja Matrimony.\"},{\"id\":2,\"title\":\"NRI Woes When Searching for The Perfect Indian Partner\",\"slug\":\"nri-woes-when-searching-for-the-perfect-indian-partner\",\"banner\":\"http://mudirajworld.runserver.in/public/uploads/all/et0p1ZFUrpQsKWVJG7vmduXuazYshGKt0h9d1MD4.jpg\",\"category_name\":\"Wedding Tips\",\"short_description\":\"NRI Woes When Searching for The Perfect Indian Partner\\r\\nShareSave\\r\\nNRI Woes When Searching for The Perfect Indian Partner\\r\\n\\r\\nMarriage is a social institution, and of course, uniformity is essential to build and maintain it. Weddings are the most celebrated occasions all over the world, irrespective of nation, culture, and boundaries. Indians are an excited lot and treat weddings and marriages as the most promising part of their lives. However, it can get mighty challenging for an NRI to find the perfect Indian partner!\",\"description\":\"Why Is It Hard for An NRI To Get an Indian Partner?Non-residents of India find it quite difficult to marry someone from the Indian community. It is because of multiple reasons including cultural contrast, different backgrounds, upbringing, living style and most of all, the distance. It gets complex for two people with different, or to be precise, opposite cultural backgrounds. Indians have an inseparable touch in almost everything from their traditions, history, genetic influence on their faith and beliefs. They are very closed in their circle, and at times, it becomes unmanageable to gel well with the other cultures. To illustrate, Indians have a versatile culture and traditional rituals which categorize them into different castes, gotras, regions and they prefer marriage within their community. They believe in not marrying outside their religion and caste to continue making pure blooded generations without any mix-up.\"},{\"id\":1,\"title\":\"Traditional Path to Partnership\",\"slug\":\"traditional-path-to-partnership\",\"banner\":\"http://mudirajworld.runserver.in/public/uploads/all/zrSvBFsoSMbHi9O0vegpwp9JYNGcdCt1kddlRzrS.jpg\",\"category_name\":\"Happy Relationship\",\"short_description\":\"In a world where time constraints often hinder the search for a life partner, mudirajmatrimony.com emerges as a beacon of hope. Balancing tradition with innovation, poojamatrimony.com ensures that love remains at the forefront of the matchmaking journey. Explore the possibilities with mudirajmatrimony.com and embark on a journey where tradition meets technology in the pursuit of lasting love.\",\"description\":\"mudirajmatrimony.com personalized matchmaking services are designed to cater to the unique needs of individuals. The dedicated relationship manager becomes a trusted guide, ensuring a smoother journey in the search for a life partner. For elite clients, the personalized pack adds an extra layer of sophistication, combining traditional values with contemporary efficiency.\"}],\"success\":1}"]}
