{"_e":"metro:client_log","_t":1790759878608,"level":"log","data":["getReviewsData response:","{\"result\":true,\"data\":{\"bg_image\":\"http://mudirajworld.runserver.in/public/uploads/all/y4padsrFZrWw9D8ks1AvlxybI9KZ55gVKDxocv22.webp\",\"items\":[{\"image\":\"http://mudirajworld.runserver.in/public/uploads/all/6Uq3izvwR7p2ZPkH64wMRUDeXbiVqhDscF6WoRD0.jpg\",\"review\":\"mudirajmatrimony.com My journey to find love had its ups and downs until I found poojamatrimony.com. This platform changed everything for me! While exploring profiles, I discovered someone special. Our conversations were effortless, thanks to mudirajmatrimony.com's easy-to-use chat system.\"},{\"image\":\"http://mudirajworld.runserver.in/public/uploads/all/um1PnciQmnbVwTRPw12KdQ2n8cFfUrhQ8aQPuEBk.jpg\",\"review\":\"mudirajmatrimony.com My journey to find love had its ups and downs until I found poojamatrimony.com. This platform changed everything for me! While exploring profiles, I discovered someone special. Our conversations were effortless, thanks to mudirajmatrimony.com's easy-to-use chat system.\"}]},\"success\":1}"]}
